      "id": "b-lv2-envelope-shape",
      "type": "state-shape",
      "props": {
        "description": "One write or clear per subject and fact type. A write replaces the fact and its evidence. Evidence-backed relationships to entity subjects; duplicate links are skipped. Admissions and merges are restricted to game_concept and pattern. At most 10 out-of-scope subjects with a reason. The consumer enqueues accepted follow-ups as drift_recheck tasks.",
